-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link"><a class="wp-block-navigation-item__content" href="https://gandhi.study/human-rights-indian-perspective/"><span class="wp-block-navigation-item__label">Human Rights â€“ Indian Perspective</span></a></li><li style="font-size: clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.208), 16px);" class=" wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link"><a class="wp-block-navigation-item__content" href="https://gandhi.study/human-security/"><span class="wp-block-navigation-item__label">Human Security</span></a></li><li style="font-size: clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.208), 16px);" class=" wp-block-navigation-item wp-block-navigation-link"><a class="wp-block-navigation-item__content" href="https://gandhi.study/women-and-peace/"><span class="wp-block-navigation-item__label">Women and Peace</span></a></li></ul></li></ul>
